  "title": "Vertiv announces global launch of chilled water rear door heat exchanger for AI and HPC applications",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced the launch of the Vertiv™ CoolLoop RDHx, a chilled water high density rear door heat exchanger (RDHx) designed to support the increasing thermal demands of AI, high-performance computing (HPC), and other power-dense IT workloads. Now available globally in capacities up to 80kW per rack, the solution is an extension of the VertivTM Liebert® DCD rear door heat exchanger family and part of Vertiv’s industry-leading thermal management portfolio.",
